[resource]
script = ExtResource("1_ngd1k")
page_title = "BASICS OF SPELLCASTING"
page_desc = "As a spellcaster, your chance of winning combat is depends on your spell comprehension and incantations. Press \"O\" to begin spellcasting.

Spells are activated by combo incantations.

I - Spellcast up
J - Spellcast left
K - Spellcast down
L - Spellcast right

Aiming your spells:
W - Aim up 
A - Aim left
S - Aim down
D - Aim right

You can also aim diagonally by combining your aiming keys.

While aiming, you can hold down \"F\" key to force stop so that you don't move. (Useful when space is limited/trying to aim at a specific target).

The stronger the spell, the more combos it requires. "
page_image = ExtResource("1_ptdsm")
metadata/_custom_type_script = "uid://bgh41gug308cv"
